<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Goa | Call 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike transport from Bangalore to Goa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To ship a bike from Bangalore to Goa you’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a signed consignment note, and a copy of the insurance policy. If the bike is financed, a No‑Objection Certificate from the lender is also required. All documents should be presented at the time of doorstep pickup to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike protected against scratches during loading and transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our team uses hydraulic ramp trailers equipped with padded loading docks, and each bike is wrapped in a 7‑layer foam system that includes bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, and weather‑proof stretch film. The bike is then secured inside a closed container with ratchet lashings, ensuring zero‑scratch transport from Bangalore to Goa.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the Bangalore‑to‑Goa journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every bike shipment is fitted with a GPS tracker linked to our live‑tracking portal. Customers receive a unique tracking ID and can view the bike’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and status updates on a mobile‑friendly dashboard from the moment it leaves Bangalore until it reaches the drop‑off point in Goa.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the cost range for bike transport from Bangalore to Goa and what factors affect it?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing typically ranges between INR 3,500 and INR 7,500 depending on bike size, weight, chosen insurance coverage, any additional services such as door‑to‑door pickup, and the urgency of delivery. Seasonal traffic, tolls on the National Highway corridors, and special handling requests (e.g., custom crates) can also influence the final quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory and what does the 100% coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Full transit insurance is optional but highly recommended. Our 100% coverage policy, approved by IRDAI, protects the declared value of your bike against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural calamities during the entire Bangalore‑to‑Goa transit. In the unlikely event of a claim, the reimbursement is processed within 7‑10 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How should I prepare my bike before the pickup in Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Before pickup, ensure the bike is clean, fuel level is below a quarter tank, and the battery is disconnected. Remove any loose accessories, lock the steering, and note existing scratches or dents. Our movers will then perform a pre‑transport inspection, photograph the bike, and confirm the condition before loading.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
